        <section class="highlight" id="highlight-section">
            <div class="container">
                <h2 class="about-heading great-vibes blue-color" data-aos="fade-top">
                    Where Nature Meets Luxury – Wildernest at SP Kingstown
                </h2>
                <div class="image-container">
                    <div class="position-relative">
                        <img src="./assets/images/about.jpg" alt="" srcset="" class="about-img" data-aos="fade-right">
                        <p class="about-para" data-aos="fade-top">
                            Step into Wildernest – a rare blend of serene landscapes and urban sophistication by
                            Shapoorji Pallonji. Nestled in a 200-acre green township in Hadapsar, Pune, Wildernest
                            offers expansive 3 & 4 Bed residences with large private decks, sunlit interiors, and
                            vastu-friendly design. Surrounded by mango orchards, scenic canals, and panoramic Sahyadri
                            views, this thoughtfully crafted community invites you to slow down and breathe easy—without
                            disconnecting from the city's convenience. This is the time to claim your perfect balance of comfort,
                            nature, and connectivity.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <button class="download-brochure" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#enquire-now"
                        id="download_brochure"><i class="icofont-download"></i> DOWNLOAD
                        BROCHURE</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
