        <section class="footer-about" id="footer-about">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="text-center" data-aos="fade-down">
                    <h2 class="footer-about-heading">About Developer</h2>
                    <img loading="lazy" src="assets/images/developer-logo.svg" alt="logo" class="developer-logo">
                </div>
                <p class="text-center mt-3" data-aos="fade-down">
                   With a rich legacy spanning over 150 years, Shapoorji Pallonji Group has evolved into a globally diversified conglomerate known for engineering excellence and innovation. Operating across six key sectors—engineering & construction, infrastructure, real estate, water, energy, and financial services—the group comprises 15 major companies and a workforce of over 33000 professionals serving more than 40 countries. Renowned for delivering complex megastructures and iconic landmarks, Shapoorji Pallonji has led the way in adopting cutting-edge technologies, being the first Indian construction company to expand overseas and pioneer top-down construction methods in India. From luxury residences and IT parks to mass housing and sustainable infrastructure, the group consistently blends scale with sustainability. Notably, Shapoorji Pallonji also holds a significant stake in Tata Sons, reinforcing its stature as one of India’s most trusted and influential corporate houses.
                </p>
                <p class="text-center">
                    <b> MahaRERA Registration No.: Mango Tree Villa Tower 1 - P52100052683 | Mango Tree Villa Tower 2 - P52100053177 | Mango Tree Villa Tower 4 - P52100053966. | https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/ | *T&C APPLY</b>
                </p>
                <div class="text-center" data-aos="fade-down">
                    <h2 class="footer-about-heading">Disclaimer</h2>
                </div>
                <p class="text-center mt-3" data-aos="fade-down">
                   Palchin Real Estates Private Limited is one of the participants in the larger scheme of development to be named as SP Kingstown. Palchin Real Estates Private Limited is presently developing residential buildings on a portion of the lands wherein it has acquired rights, which lands have been offered to form part of SP Kingstown. ₹1.84 Cr^ is the starting price for a 3 BHK Unit, Tower 2 – 8th Floor to 14th floor, Series 3 and 4. This price is the base consideration value and excludes applicable taxes, other charges, stamp duty, registration charges or any other statutory charges as applicable. ^This is a bank subvention scheme offered by ICICI Bank; subject to eligibility and for bookings done till 31st December 2025. The amount of ₹9.9 lakh is calculated for flats of series 3 & 4 from the 15th floor and above in Tower 2. As per this Scheme, the customer’s total self-contribution would be 25% of the sale consideration value and the balance 75% of the sale consideration value shall be disbursed by the bank on behalf of the customer based on the payment schedule/plan. Towers 1, 2 & 4 at Mango Tree Villa are mortgaged to Vistra ITCL (India) Limited, whose NOC will be provided for the sale of flats therein.T&C apply.

                </p> <!-- <p class="text-center mb-0">
                    <img src="./assets/images/qr-code.jpg" alt="" srcset="">
                </p> -->
                <div class="row justify-content-center">

                    <p class="text-center mt-3 font-14 disclaimer"><a href="privacy.html"> Privacy Policy</a></p>
                </div>
            </div>
